# hcp::registry module Kconfig
# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
menuconfig HCP_REGISTRY
	bool "HCP registry (Modbus point table, downloaded config, persistence)"
	default y
	help
	  The point table the collector polls: what to read, from which slave, how
	  often, and where to report it. Holds the rules for a table downloaded from
	  Home Assistant (a re-download always wins, only a change is persisted, a
	  payload with no segments array is ignored) and its serialized form in
	  hcp::storage. Pure logic - no kernel, no hardware - so the rules are covered
	  by the host test suite.

if HCP_REGISTRY

endif
